/* ============================================================================================================
 * PART 1 · THE HEAVY-VEHICLE KIT — shared by the old world's lorries, buses and farm machines (the same in each).
 *
 * Built for traffic: hundreds of these are drawn at once, so a vehicle is a handful of meshes (everything of one
 * material merged), a few thousand triangles, its wear laid on as vertex colours and one small grime picture in
 * metres, never as geometry. What the page drives keeps its own node and its name:
 *   light:head · light:tail · light:brake · light:indicator-l · light:indicator-r · light:beacon-amber
